  "slug": "music",
  "audio_url": "/audio/russian/20509_music.mp3",
  "english_paragraphs": [
    "I like music, I listen to a lot of music every day. In the morning, I listen to music in the car; in the evening, I listen to music at home. Music is my good friend.",
    "My mother likes to listen to slow music, my father likes to listen to old music, and my sister likes to listen to fast music. I like them all.",
    "Because I like listening to music, I also like singing. I can sing a lot of songs, and my good friends and I often sing together.",
    "I can't dance, but I think it doesn't matter if I can't dance."
  ],
  "english_full": "I like music, I listen to a lot of music every day. In the morning, I listen to music in the car; in the evening, I listen to music at home. Music is my good friend.\n\nMy mother likes to listen to slow music, my father likes to listen to old music, and my sister likes to listen to fast music. I like them all.\n\nBecause I like listening to music, I also like singing. I can sing a lot of songs, and my good friends and I often sing together.\n\nI can't dance, but I think it doesn't matter if I can't dance.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Мне нра́вится му́зыка, я слу́шаю мно́го му́зыки ка́ждый день. У́тром я слу́шаю му́зыку в авто́; ве́чером я слу́шаю му́зыку до́ма. Му́зыка — мой хоро́ший друг.",
    "Ма́ма люби́т слу́шать ме́дленную му́зыку, ба́тька люби́т слу́шать ста́рую му́зыку, а сестра́ люби́т слу́шать бы́струю му́зыку. Мне нра́вятся все́ они.",
    "Потому что я люби́т слу́шать му́зыку, я то́же люби́т пе́ть. Я могу́ спеть мно́го пе́сен, и мои́ хоро́шие дру́зья и я ча́сто пе́ем вме́сте.",
    "Я не могу́ танцева́ть, но я ду́маю, что нева́жно, если я не могу́ танцева́ть."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Mne nrávitsya múzyka, ya slúshayum mnógo múzyki kázhdy den'. Útrom ya slúshayum múzyku v avtó; vécherom ya slúshayum múzyku dóma. Múzyka — moy khoróshiy drug.",
    "Máma lyubít slúshat' médlenuyu múzyku, bát'ka lyubít slúshat' stáruyu múzyku, a sestrá lyubít slúshat' býstruyu múzyku. Mne nrávyatsya vsé oni.",
    "Potomu chto ya lyubít slúshat' múzyku, ya tózhe lyubít pét'. Ya mogú spet' mnógo pésen, i moí khoróshie drúz'ya i ya chásto péyem vméste.",
    "Ya ne mogú tancevá́t', no ya dúmayu, chto nevázhno, esli ya ne mogú tancevá́t'."
  ],
